ing the Heinkel He 111 bomber, the T-34 tank, the Hawker Typhoon fighter and the Tiger tank.\n\nNew to the series is a choice of nine commanders, among them George Patton and Bernard Montgomery, each with unique abilities that support different styles of attack. Over 20 single-player scenarios and a skirmish mode built around challenges provide the content. Tactics include exploiting weak spots in armour, ambushing, and garrisoning buildings with infantry. The game suits strategy fans who like to plan engagements carefully."}}